        "subtitle": "Advanced Galvanic Current Stabilization",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Unrivaled Durability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the structural integrity and professional performance of the Ioniderm, regular surface sanitation with a soft cloth formulated for clinical environments must be performed after every treatment shift. The outer chassis features specialized chemical resistance properties, ensuring an as-new condition outcome across a 15-to-20-year operational lifespan. Consistent care guarantees optimal current conductivity, prevents accessory wear, and maximizes return on salon investment.</p>",
